{"id":8182034,"docketId":65279648,"caseName":"Tananevicz v. Illinois","caseNameFull":"John M. Tananevicz v. People of the State of Illinois","slug":"tananevicz-v-illinois","docketNumber":"No. 312","dateFiled":"1920-03-15","dateArgued":null,"dateCertGranted":null,"year":1920,"scdbId":"","direction":"","votesMajority":null,"votesMinority":null,"disposition":"","posture":"","syllabus":null,"summary":"<p>Error to the Supreme Court of the State of Illinois.</p>","headnotes":null,"proceduralHistory":null,"attorneys":"Mr. Emory J. Smith tor plaintiff in error., Mr. Edward J. Brundage and Mr. Edward C. Fitch for defendant in error.","natureOfSuit":"","citationCount":0,"judges":"","jurisdictionType":"","opinions":[{"id":8143953,"type":"majority","typeCode":"020lead","perCuriam":false,"author":"","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":2176,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"majority\">\n<author id=\"ALz\">\n<em>Per Curiam.</em>\n</author>\n<p id=\"AFC\">Dismissed for want of jurisdiction upon the authority of: (1) <em>Consolidated Turnpike Co. </em>v. <em>Norfolk, etc., Ry. Co., </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"97851\"><a href=\"/opinion/97851/consolidated-turnpike-co-v-norfolk-ocean-view-railway-co/#334\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Consolidated Turnpike Co. v. Norfolk &amp; Ocean View Railway...\">228 U. S. 326, 334</a></span>; <em>St. Louis &amp; San Francisco R. R. Co. </em>v. <em>Shepherd, </em><page-number citation-index=\"1\" label=\"569\">*569</page-number><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"98657\"><a href=\"/opinion/98657/st-louis-san-francisco-railroad-v-shepherd/#241\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: St. Louis &amp; San Francisco Railroad v. Shepherd\">240 U. S. 240, 241</a></span>; <em>Bilby </em>v. <em>Stewart, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"99116\"><a href=\"/opinion/99116/bilby-v-stewart/#257\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Bilby v. Stewart\">246 U. S. 255, 257</a></span>. (2) <em>Brolan </em>v. <em>United States,